      "reasoning": "My opponent played a \"Memory Vessel\", a curious choice. It does nothing for now but threatens to disrupt my hand later on. No matter. I have drawn a \"Breeding Pool\". An excellent draw. This will allow me to have all three of my colors available.\n\
