rance - Whenever you discard a card, choose one that hasn\\u0027t been chosen this turn \\u0026mdash;\\u0026bull Draw a card.\\u0026bull Create a Treasure token.\\u0026bull Each opponent loses 3 life.\\nMiMo Trash - Ability triggers: Monument to Endurance - Whenever you discard a card, choose one that hasn\\u0027t been chosen this turn \\u0026mdash;\\u0026bull Draw a card.\\u0026bull Create a Treasure token.\\u0026bull Each opponent loses 3 life.\\nMiMo Trash creates a Treasure Token token\\nMiMo Trash draws a card\\nMiMo Trash puts a card from library into their hand\\nMiMo Trash puts a card from library into their hand\\nMiMo Trash puts a card from library into their hand\\nMiMo Trash puts Accumulate Wisdom from stack into their graveyard\\nMiMo Trash creates a Treasure Token token\\n[Chat] MiMo Trash: Quench my Abandon Attachments? Nah, let it get countered. I\\u0026#39;ll let this one go.\\nMiMo Trash chooses not to pay {2} to prevent the counter effect\\nMiMo Trash puts Abandon Attachments from stack into their graveyard (source: It\\u0027ll Quench Ya!)\\nAbandon Attachments is countered by It\\u0027ll Quench Ya!\\nMiMo Trash puts It\\u0027ll Quench Ya! from stack into their graveyard\\n[Chat] MiMo Trash: With two treasures and a fresh Abandon Attachments, let me set up a value engine. Firebending Lesson into Monument triggers!\\nMiMo Trash discards Stormchaser\\u0027s Talent (source: Artist\\u0027s Talent)\\nMiMo Trash paid for Artist\\u0027s Talent - Discard a card and draw a card?\\nMiMo Trash draws a card\\nMiMo Trash - Ability triggers: Monument to Endurance - Whenever you discard a card, choose one that hasn\\u0027t been chosen this turn \\u0026mdash;\\u0026bull Draw a card.\\u0026bull Create a Treasure token.\\u0026bull Each opponent loses 3 life.\\nMiMo Trash - Ability triggers: Monument to Endurance - Whenever you discard a card, choose one that hasn\\u0027t been chosen this turn \\u0026mdash;\\u0026bull Draw a card.\\u0026bull Create a Treasure token.