      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With 4 lands already in the kept hand (Island, 2x Spirebluff Canal, Willowrush Verge), bottoming Accumulate Wisdom instead of the Island means keeping an excess land over a cheap cantrip that synergizes with the Lesson theme (Toph, Combustion Technique). The hand is already land-heavy at 4 lands with only 3 spells.",
