    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gran-Gran's triggered ability requires discarding a card on becoming tapped. The player discarded Steam Vents, which is a dual land they could play next turn to fix mana. Meanwhile, they have Lesson cards (Boomerang Basics, Combustion Technique, Accumulate Wisdom) that they actively want in the graveyard to power up Gran-Gran's cost reduction ability (3+ Lessons in graveyard) and to power up Combustion Technique's damage and Accumulate Wisdom's card advantage. Discarding a Lesson card here would progress toward the 3-Lesson threshold while the Steam Vents could be played as a land drop.",
